<div class="flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-4">
    <BzBubble Variant="BubbleVariant.Secondary" Tail="BubbleTail.Top">
        <BzBubbleContent>Tail Top is the WhatsApp corner: it points at the avatar, on the FIRST bubble of a run.</BzBubbleContent>
    </BzBubble>
    <BzBubble Variant="BubbleVariant.Secondary" Tail="BubbleTail.Bottom">
        <BzBubbleContent>Tail Bottom is the Telegram corner: it finishes the LAST bubble of a run.</BzBubbleContent>
    </BzBubble>
    <BzBubble Align="BubbleAlign.End" Tail="BubbleTail.Top">
        <BzBubbleContent>Both mirror to the end side for outgoing messages.</BzBubbleContent>
    </BzBubble>
    <BzBubble Align="BubbleAlign.End" Variant="BubbleVariant.Tinted" Tail="BubbleTail.Bottom">
        <BzBubbleContent>And the tail always matches the variant's fill.</BzBubbleContent>
    </BzBubble>
</div>
